'''Great Ape Luza''' (超猿獣ルーザ, ''Chō Enjū Rūza'', '''Super Ape-Beast Luza''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] enemy found in [[Humanity Catified]]. It is one of the two enemy versions of [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], the other being [[Zero Luza]]. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

